OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA mainly dry and bright morning
OL,6,Fwith some sunny spells. Mostly cloudy
OL,7,Fin the afternoon with showers or the
OL,8,Fodd longer spell of rain by evening.
OL,9,FBreezy.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FCloudy with rain or showers
OL,12,Fthis evening. Drier and clearer spells
OL,13,Fdeveloping through Angus overnight,
OL,14,Fbut still some showers, these most
OL,15,Ffrequent in the west. Windy.
OL,16,
OL,17,CFriday:FBright spells and showers, the
OL,18,Fshowers heavy at times and most
OL,19,Ffrequent in the west. Fresh to strong
OL,20,Fwest or southwest winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
