OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FBright
OL,6,Fwith scattered showers and easing
OL,7,Fwinds on Saturday. Windy with rain or
OL,8,Fshowers on Sunday. Bright with
OL,9,Foccasional showers and easing winds on
OL,10,FMonday.
